_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2e7258f1dfea51c8END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-3434d2079e27b293END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GEN_Races_OralHistories_MFGith</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_Races_OralHistories_MFGith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_Races_OralHistories_MFGith\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">baed9260-f84f-460e-8450-33fb6bed7ba4</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:baed9260-f84f-460e-8450-33fb6bed7ba4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:baed9260-f84f-460e-8450-33fb6bed7ba4\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Found by reading Stone Tablets in the <a href=\"/wiki/Enclave_Library\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enclave Library\">Enclave Library</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-442&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;40</span></li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a></li>\n<li>On a bookshelf in the south-eastern corner of the 4th floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Tower\" title=\"Arcane Tower\">Arcane Tower</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-31&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;296</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This book comprises several chapters, one for each cited source. It claims to contain first-hand transcriptions of the oral histories of several storytellers throughout the realm.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Chapter 4\n</p><p>Pallidor the Swift\n</p><p>700 years of age\n</p><p>Wood Elf storyteller hailing from the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Wood_of_Sharp_Teeth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wood of Sharp Teeth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Wood_of_Sharp_Teeth\">Wood of Sharp Teeth</a></span>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>It took me several tendays of quiet habitation in the wood before the venerable <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pallidor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pallidor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Pallidor\">Pallidor</a></span> felt comfortable revealing his presence to me. The longer I stayed, demonstrating I was no threat to his health and peace, the more open he was to gentle inquiry. This tale, relayed to me on a chilly morning as we stoked a small fire between us, was like none I had heard before or since. I asked if it were fiction and he insisted emphatically it was as true as his own right eye.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Long ago\n</p><p>Before my eyes and ears,\n</p><p>Before your lonesome quill, dear scribe,\n</p><p>There was an empire of people - \n</p><p>Or perhaps only Belief.\n</p><p>An empire of brain-eaters, soul-wasters -\n</p><p>They called themselves illithids;\n</p><p>the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind flayer\">flayers of minds</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>The children of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gith\">Gith</a></span> were bowed,\n</p><p>bent in service to the flayers.\n</p><p>A passionate people\n</p><p>Made to serve a cold Belief.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>The flayers were untouchable,\n</p><p>Their minds a great oppressor.\n</p><p>No proud will or passion\n</p><p>Could break Gith's children free.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Until, at last, a reckoning -\n</p><p>Its source unknown; its power, unproven.\n</p><p>But its events, history-making:\n</p><p>The cowed would not be cracked.\n</p><p>Gith's children fought back, valiantly,\n</p><p>Their freedom theirs - the flayers bent,\n</p><p>And broken, till today.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oral_Histories_of_Faer%C3%BBn:_Paladin_Oathbreakers\" title=\"Oral Histories of Faerûn: Paladin Oathbreakers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Oral_Histories_of_Faer%C3%BBn:_Paladin_Oathbreakers\" title=\"Oral Histories of Faerûn: Paladin Oathbreakers\">Oral Histories of Faerûn: Paladin Oathbreakers</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oral_Histories_of_Faer%C3%BBn:_The_Spellplague\" title=\"Oral Histories of Faerûn: The Spellplague\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Oral_Histories_of_Faer%C3%BBn:_The_Spellplague\" title=\"Oral Histories of Faerûn: The Spellplague\">Oral Histories of Faerûn: The Spellplague</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714230748\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2934/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 54463/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22038/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1189932/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   60.658      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   60.658      1 -total\n 40.70%   24.688     10 Template:Icon_text\n 37.66%   22.843     35 Template:Trim\n 23.05%   13.981      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 17.34%   10.517      2 Template:Item_icon\n 15.76%    9.559      5 Template:Icon_link\n 15.09%    9.150      2 Template:Uid\n 11.68%    7.086     14 Template:Ifempty\n 10.40%    6.309      1 Template:Main_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12509-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714230748 and revision id 330077. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}